    "detailed_description": "A Real Man Lasts 15 Minutes!!!<br>Survive the endless horde of skeletons and defeat the final BOSS!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exhilarating Musou Combat</h2>Lots of different weapons to choose from.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188460/extras/4033002eceab9a531181fdf4473e0217.poster.avif?t=1753923862\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188460/extras/4033002eceab9a531181fdf4473e0217.webm?t=1753923862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188460/extras/4033002eceab9a531181fdf4473e0217.mp4?t=1753923862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Varied Challenges</h2>Each battle takes place on a different random map, and each map features unique special monsters.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188460/extras/7513ab2f986d6008fe479ee5fa24c9d4.poster.avif?t=1753923862\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188460/extras/7513ab2f986d6008fe479ee5fa24c9d4.webm?t=1753923862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188460/extras/7513ab2f986d6008fe479ee5fa24c9d4.mp4?t=1753923862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lots of ways to enhance and build up</h2>Enhancement Options count 100+.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188460/extras/6f5efdefdcb331f7b437e437dbe5e5c2.poster.avif?t=1753923862\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.st